{"id":"d3bce54f4db028d4","group":"67","path":"67/67-cor-interpretability-sigma1-extension.md","title":"Sigma1 Extensions Preserve Interpretability","display":"cor-interpretability-sigma1-extension — Sigma1 Extensions Preserve Interpretability","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-cor-interpretability-sigma1-extension","aliases":["67-cor-interpretability-sigma1-extension"],"display":"cor-interpretability-sigma1-extension — Sigma1 Extensions Preserve Interpretability","depends_on":["[[67-thm-interpretability-pi1]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","[[67-df-interpretability]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §1，Corollary 3，印刷页 81；PDF 第 92 页","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"已核对陈述并补出 Pi1 后果推导与不一致扩张的分支；保留 Theorem 6 上游限制","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-cor-interpretability-sigma1-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-cor-interpretability-sigma1-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-interpretability-sigma1-extension — Sigma1 Extensions Preserve Interpretability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8b478f37907667f0\" href=\"?note=8b478f37907667f0\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-pi1\">67-thm-interpretability-pi1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，Corollary 3，印刷页 81；PDF 第 92 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"已核对陈述并补出 Pi1 后果推导与不一致扩张的分支；保留 Theorem 6 上游限制"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致、原始递归 PA 扩张；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>；扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}\">\\(A\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}\">\\(B\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}\\)</span> 不额外假设一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\unlhd B\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nA\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}\\unlhd B\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\unlhd B\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nA\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}\\unlhd B\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A+\\sigma\\vdash\\pi\">\\(A+\\sigma\\vdash\\pi\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\vdash\\sigma\\to\\pi\">\\(A\\vdash\\sigma\\to\\pi\\)</span>；后者仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>，故由 Theorem 6 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\vdash\\sigma\\to\\pi\">\\(B\\vdash\\sigma\\to\\pi\\)</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B+\\sigma\\vdash\\pi\">\\(B+\\sigma\\vdash\\pi\\)</span>。当两扩张一致时，再用 Theorem 6 即得结论。</p>\n<p>边界情形也闭合：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A+\\sigma\">\\(A+\\sigma\\)</span> 不一致，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\vdash\\neg\\sigma\">\\(A\\vdash\\neg\\sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\sigma\">\\(\\neg\\sigma\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\vdash\\neg\\sigma\">\\(B\\vdash\\neg\\sigma\\)</span>，目标扩张也不一致；不一致目标证明任何合法全域解释的翻译。若仅目标扩张不一致，同理直接取全域恒等解释。不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 改成任意句子而沿用此论证。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，用户提供的 Cambridge/ASL 2016 重印本 PDF；第 6 章 §1，Corollary 3，印刷页 81；PDF 第 92 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：已核对陈述并补出 Pi1 后果推导与不一致扩张的分支；保留 Theorem 6 上游限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-pi1","status":"resolved","id":"8b478f37907667f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-interpretability-pi1]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是一致、原始递归 PA 扩张；$\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$，$\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1$ 取 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\unlhd$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]；扩张 $A\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}$、$B\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}$ 不额外假设一致。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd","display":false},{"tex":"A\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\unlhd B\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nA\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}\\unlhd B\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"A+\\sigma\\vdash\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"A\\vdash\\sigma\\to\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"B\\vdash\\sigma\\to\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"B+\\sigma\\vdash\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"A+\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A\\vdash\\neg\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"B\\vdash\\neg\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":2054,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-cor-interpretability-sigma1-extension]]"}],"outgoing":["8b478f37907667f0","851cd80e64893935","44cd21d3d12e4d8d"]}